# Code Quality Standards

Follow `.agentic/lib/quality_knowledge/code_quality.knowledge.md` and `.agentic/lib/quality_knowledge/testing.knowledge.md`.

## Programming Standards

- Security first: validate input, parameterized queries, no hardcoded secrets
- Clear naming: descriptive, not cryptic
- Small functions (<50 lines)
- Explicit error handling
- Keep changes incremental — prefer small diffs

## Testing Standards

- Test happy path, edge cases, invalid input
- Test time-based behavior with mock clocks
- Use descriptive test names with F-#### and AC-### identifiers
- Tests must be deterministic and independent
- Run `ag intel test [F-XXXX]` before writing tests for quality guidance

## Before Writing Code

- Check `ag intel implement [F-XXXX]` for patterns, prior art, and quality guidance
- Read existing code before modifying — understand conventions
- Check STACK.md for project-specific tooling and frameworks
